<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH LEAGUE PLAYOFF RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH LEAGUE PLAYOFF RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>MALLORCA, Spain 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the first leg of the play-off to decide a place in the Spanish first division on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Mallorca 1 Rayo Vallecano 0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Barbero 21</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000.</p>
<p>Return leg to be played on Sunday.</p>
</text>
